# PersonalAddonBlockLog holds the refusals BlockWatch records, with their
# stacks, so they survive a reload (Architecture/20260924-Patch01Implementation.md
# section 4.4). Bounded at 16 records; /pa blocked clear empties it.
# PersonalAddonDiagnostics holds counters and fault notes from the last five
# sessions (Architecture/20261002-Phase09.md section 3); /pa diag clear empties it.
